# DisasterWatch Frontend Environment Variables
# For Phase 1 (Monday Exhibition), NO environment variables are required!
# The app works out-of-the-box with live USGS feeds and public ESRI dark basemaps.

# Phase 2 (Spring Boot Backend Integration):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8080/api/v1
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SSE_STREAM_URL=http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stream/events
